sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Customer
  participant P as Platform
  participant PDB as Platform DB
  participant V as Venue
  C->>P: POST /orders + Idempotency-Key
  P->>PDB: order + items + history + outbox (tx)
  P-->>C: 202 + order_id + tracking_token
  P->>V: confirm_order (order_id idempotency)
  V->>V: validate and reserve (tx)
  V-->>P: accepted/rejected
  P->>PDB: status + history + complete outbox (tx)
